# Bridge templates staged into the wheel by `scripts/stage_wheel_bridges.py`.
# Their `dist/` build outputs must be committable so a source build can package
# them, so it is un-ignored here against the repo-wide `dist/` rule above.
!python/adobe/_bridges/**/dist/
